Z||000031||onfire||03-21-2001||03:38 AM||||Do not put a clipboard on the dash above the steering wheel. It will fall and jam your steering, while trying to mak a turn.<P>My friend did this when he was driving my 85 GT at the warehouse I work at. We have a yard where we park containers, and its shaped like an oval. Every once and awhile me and him would go out to see who could get the fastest times around the yard. He was driving hard into a corner the clipboard fell jammed the steering wheel. He locked the brakes up, heading straight for a container. The car stopped, with the nose under the container, about 6 inches from the windsheild. Thats the last time we did that.||||reg||4
